    {
      "voiceId": "russell-brand",
      "voiceName": "Russell Brand",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The solidarity and bravery of the Irish is inspiring.\n\n\nConor McGregor (@TheNotoriousMMA)\n\nNational Strike Tomorrow, we are SHUTTING DOWN HARD! \ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddea \n\nWe stand shoulder to shoulder with our fuel protesters, farmers, truckers, hauliers, and all the hard working Irish that have been left without so much as a hope of survival under this tyrannical government reign. \n\nWhile Irish families are freezing in their homes and businesses are being bled dry by extortionate energy costs, those in power continu",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/rustyrockets/status/2043491735381176625",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-13T00:49:30+00:00",
